WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.291
Unit eighteen. Volunteering!

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:13.427
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Pre-Intermediate level!

3
00:00:13.477 --> 00:00:17.902
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.952 --> 00:00:22.089
Today we learn: Volunteering. Let's go!

5
00:00:23.201 --> 00:00:27.284
Volunteer. Say it with me. Volunteer!

6
00:00:30.796 --> 00:00:34.663
Charity. Say it with me. Charity!

7
00:00:38.151 --> 00:00:41.835
Donate. Say it with me. Donate!

8
00:00:45.319 --> 00:00:48.785
Cause. Say it with me. Cause!

9
00:00:52.296 --> 00:00:56.413
Give back. Say it with me. Give back!

10
00:00:59.905 --> 00:01:04.155
Selfless. Say it with me. Selfless!

11
00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:11.487
Impact. Say it with me. Impact!

12
00:01:14.984 --> 00:01:19.384
Organize. Say it with me. Organize!

13
00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:32.253
Grammar time! Infinitive of purpose. Listen. I volunteer to help my community.

14
00:01:32.303 --> 00:01:37.914
Your turn. Say it with me. I volunteer to help my community.

15
00:01:42.874 --> 00:01:53.695
Volunteering for a good cause is a selfless way to give back to society. Whether you donate time or money to a charity, even small actions can make a real impact.

16
00:01:53.745 --> 00:01:55.187
I like this story!

17
00:01:55.939 --> 00:02:00.996
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:01.046 --> 00:02:02.196
Donate!

19
00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:08.731
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:08.781 --> 00:02:09.931
Impact!

21
00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:19.706
Think and answer. What cause would you like to volunteer for, and why?

22
00:02:19.756 --> 00:02:20.906
Great answer!

23
00:02:21.945 --> 00:02:25.051
This unit's value is Generosity.

24
00:02:25.101 --> 00:02:27.909
I can show generosity every day!

25
00:02:28.609 --> 00:02:33.238
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:33.288 --> 00:02:34.866
Goodbye, everyone!

